{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026WbZNWCtMCg1794908913.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>石鼓洲I.PARK1焚化爐大樓上月底發生三級火，消防處調查後，指是燒焊或吸煙導致。<br/></p><p>消防處指完成三級火調查，包括在現場蒐證及向相關人士錄取口供。</p><p><br/>調查顯示起火地點位於焚化爐大樓，第三焚化模組高層位置。已排除火警與電力故障，蓄意縱火及化學物質自燃有關。火警可能與燒焊工程或吸煙有關，已轉交環保署跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:32:19.580045+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T09:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T02:37:36.317712+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T10:25:43.193725+00:00","content_hash":"6b0cdb1ca8325887eab774eca800aa1b30e96384127d774a1eee60fe87e8fc50","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:32:19.580045+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}